THIRD-PARTY NOTICES
================================================================================

Portions of `references/voice-tells.md` are derived from a separate,
MIT-licensed prose skill by a different author. Specifically:

  - Part 1, the vocabulary list of flagged words and phrases, is adapted from
    that work's banned word/phrase list.
  - Part 2, six of the hard rules (em dash budget, semicolons, straight quotes,
    banned vocabulary, negation framing, and sentence-length spread), are
    adapted from that work's hard rules. Each is marked "(derived)" inline.

Everything else in this skill is original, including the three review passes and
their prompts, the finding-category checklist, the eight documentation-register
rewrite levers, the reviewer checklist, the rewrite-then-rescan gate, and both
scripts.

